”额外生成血珠，并且生成血珠时回复一定生命值。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","「血の魔法陣」で追加の血の雫を生成し、血の雫が生成されるたびにHPを回復"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","展开“鲜血法阵”时，会在最初的3秒内额外生成3颗血珠。每次生成血珠时，眷属和苔佩希回复相当于苔佩希200% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「血の魔法陣」を展開する時、最初の3秒間に追加の血の雫を3個生成。血の雫が生成されるたびに、テペシュと眷属のHPをテペシュの200% ATK分回復"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":62,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至250% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","血の雫生成時のHP回復量が250% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希会为眷属赋予永久的霸体状态，眷属在“鲜血渴望”状态下参与击败敌方非召唤物时，会立即回复40% HP生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","眷属に永続的にスーパーアーマー効果を付与。さらに、「鮮血の渇望」状態の眷属が召喚ユニット以外の敵の撃破に関与するたびに、眷属のHPが40% HP分回復"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":29,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":46,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":49,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":66,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","血の雫生成時のHP回復量が300% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“鲜血渴望”在满足击败或持续条件后永久持续，并提升眷属造成的伤害。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","一定の条件を満たした後、「鮮血の渇望」状態が永続になり、眷属の与ダメージUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当眷属在“鲜血渴望”状态下累计参与击败敌方非召唤物达到2次或累计处于“鲜血渴望”状态12秒后，该状态将永久持续。并且使眷属造成的伤害提升30%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「鮮血の渇望」状態の眷属が合計2回、召喚ユニット以外の敵の撃破に関与した時、または「鮮血の渇望」状態の持続時間が合計12秒に達した時、「鮮血の渇望」状態が永続になり、その後、眷属の与ダメージ+30%"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","遮月蝠翼伞"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","月隠しの蝙蝠傘"]]}